        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mul-T-Lock Yale Grade 1 Commercial Security Door Knobs\r\n</b>\r\n<p>\r\nMUL-T-LOCK's  cylindrical locksets are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. Each keyed function Lockset is fitted with a MUL-T-LOCK 206S High Security lock cylinder. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/mul-t-lock-grade-1-high-security-lock-commercial-door-lever\"><b>Mul-T-Lock Grade 1 ADA  Compliant Security Levers</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nVarious functions available for just about any application. Like all MUL-T-LOCK Products the Yale line of Locksets are protected by MUL-T-LOCK's Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty. All keyed functions are supplied with two (2) keys and owner key card. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features </b> for Mul-T-Lock Grade 1 Commercial Security Knobs\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 1 Locking Mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Lock Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206S Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n<li>UL Fire Rated Latch</li>\r\n<li>2-3/4\" Backset Latch</li>\r\n<li>UL437 Drill and Pick Resistance Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>US26D <b>Satin Chrome Finish</b></li>\r\n<!-- <li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li> -->\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMUL-T-LOCK's locks are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the only person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Remove the worry about anyone making duplicates of your keys. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Passage:</b> Both Knobs are always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy:</b> Push button locking inside. Can be unlocked from outside with small screwdriver.</li>\r\n<li><b>Entrance Lock:</b> Push button locking inside. Keyed locking outside.</li>\r\n<li><b>Classroom Lock:</b> Outside Knob locked and unlocked by key. Inside knob always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom Lock:</b> Outside Knob fixed, entrance by key only. Inside knob always unlocked.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Grade 1 Mul-T-Lock Security Door Knob Lockset",
                "description": "Mul-T-Lock Grade 1 Knob Lockset. Highest security restricted key  Grade 1 Commercial door knobs. Available in passage, privacy, keyed entry, classroom or storeroom functions in Satin Chrome.",
